  "title": "Coconut Chicken in the Air Fryer",
  "description": "These 30-minute chicken tenders are breaded in a cornflake-coconut crust and air-fried for a lighter and tropical take on fried chicken.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-07-16T19:59:17-04:00",
